"Search history" = "搜索历史";
"History is off" = "历史已关闭";
"Turn on clipboard history in Settings to use this panel." = "在设置中开启剪贴板历史后即可使用此面板。";
"type" = "键入";
"copy" = "复制";
"pick" = "选择";
"close" = "关闭";
"Drag to move" = "拖动可移动";
"%d characters · %@" = "%d 字 · %@";
"Panel hotkey" = "面板热键";
"Panel position" = "面板位置";
"Below the menu bar icon" = "菜单栏图标下方";
"Near the text cursor" = "文本光标附近";
"Screen center" = "屏幕中央";
"Custom" = "自定义";
"Uses the Accessibility API to find the cursor. Apps that don't expose it (VNC, remote desktops, VMs, terminals) fall back to the menu bar icon." = "通过辅助功能接口获取光标位置。不提供该信息的应用（VNC、远程桌面、虚拟机、终端）会回退到菜单栏图标下方。";
"Open the panel with the hotkey, then drag it anywhere. The position is saved when you let go." = "用热键呼出面板后，直接把它拖到任意位置，松手即保存。";
"Reset position" = "重置位置";
"Press the hotkey, pick an item with 1–9 or ↑↓ and Return, and it is typed into the focused field. ⌘Return copies it instead." = "按下热键，用 1–9 或 ↑↓ 加回车选择条目，即可键入到当前聚焦的输入框；⌘回车则只复制到剪贴板。";
"History panel" = "历史面板";

/* ホットキー録音 */
"Press keys…" = "请按下组合键…";
"Click, then press the new shortcut. Esc cancels." = "点击后按下新的快捷键，Esc 取消。";
"Default" = "默认";
"Type clipboard" = "键入剪贴板";
"%@ could not be registered — another app is probably using it. Pick a different shortcut." = "%@ 无法注册——很可能已被其他应用占用，请换一个快捷键。";
"Focus the target field, press the hotkey, and the clipboard text is typed in. Click the shortcut to record a new one — hold at least one of Control (⌃), Option (⌥), Shift (⇧) or Command (⌘) while pressing a key." = "聚焦目标输入框，按下热键，剪贴板文本就会被打出。点击快捷键可重新录制——按住 Control (⌃)、Option (⌥)、Shift (⇧)、Command (⌘) 中至少一个，再按一个键。";
"Items shown" = "显示条数";
